{"id":"fceaada2b896f5e2","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-consistency-strength.md","title":"Consistency Strength","display":"df-consistency-strength — Consistency Strength","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-consistency-strength","aliases":["92-df-consistency-strength"],"display":"df-consistency-strength — Consistency Strength","depends_on":["[[92-df-theory-set]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-provable]]","[[92-df-theory-system]]","[[92-df-parametrized-consistency-statement]]"],"source":"本地相容性强度约定；一致性句机制见第 IX 章 pp. 106–108（PDF 123–125）","source_status":"本地扩展定义"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-consistency-strength"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-consistency-strength</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-consistency-strength — Consistency Strength"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"975b3aa9a1e08797\" href=\"?note=975b3aa9a1e08797\" title=\"92-df-theory-set\">92-df-theory-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"09b80989dbe14044\" href=\"?note=09b80989dbe14044\" title=\"92-df-theory-system\">92-df-theory-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a02811a5f1367e7a\" href=\"?note=a02811a5f1367e7a\" title=\"92-df-parametrized-consistency-statement\">92-df-parametrized-consistency-statement</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地相容性强度约定；一致性句机制见第 IX 章 pp. 106–108（PDF 123–125）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地扩展定义"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(B,T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (base theory and compared theories, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"975b3aa9a1e08797\" href=\"?note=975b3aa9a1e08797\" title=\"92-df-theory-set\">92-df-theory-set</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sys}_G(B),\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T),\\mathrm{Sys}_G(U)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(B),\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T),\\mathrm{Sys}_G(U)\\)</span> (canonical formal-system presentations, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"09b80989dbe14044\" href=\"?note=09b80989dbe14044\" title=\"92-df-theory-system\">92-df-theory-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_T,\\mathrm{Con}_U\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_T,\\mathrm{Con}_U\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (arithmetized consistency sentences for the chosen presentations of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,U\">\\(T,U\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"a02811a5f1367e7a\" href=\"?note=a02811a5f1367e7a\" title=\"92-df-parametrized-consistency-statement\">92-df-parametrized-consistency-statement</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> (provability relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{Con}}^B\">\\(\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{Con}}^B\\)</span> (definition-target relative consistency-strength relation)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}strength}\\vdash\nT\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{Con}}^B U\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Sys}_G(B)\\vdash(\\mathrm{Con}_U\\to\\mathrm{Con}_T)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}strength}\\vdash\nT\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{Con}}^B U\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Sys}_G(B)\\vdash(\\mathrm{Con}_U\\to\\mathrm{Con}_T)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{Con}}^B U\">\\(T\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{Con}}^B U\\)</span>表示背景系统<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sys}_G(B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(B)\\)</span>能证明“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>相容则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>相容”，所以按本约定<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>至少具有<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>的相容性强度</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>是句子集，故可证关系必须由<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sys}_G(B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(B)\\)</span>承载；把<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>直接放在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span>左边会混淆集合与形式系统</li>\n<li>该比较依赖<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,U\">\\(T,U\\)</span>的有效呈现、所选证明谓词以及背景理论<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>；更换编码通常需在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>中证明相应等价，不能只凭下标名称识别</li>\n<li>关系在适当背景下可按可证等价类研究；它本身不是“可靠性、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>一致性、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>一致性”的无条件线性层级定义</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>关系依赖所选一致性句。其一般签名应引用 parametrized-consistency-statement，而非只定义固定 PA 句 Con_G 的节点；更换谓词或呈现需要背景理论证明相应等价。</p>\n<p>原书定位：本地相容性强度约定；一致性句机制见第 IX 章 pp. 106–108（PDF 123–125）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-theory-set","status":"resolved","id":"975b3aa9a1e08797","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-system","status":"resolved","id":"09b80989dbe14044","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-parametrized-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"a02811a5f1367e7a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-parametrized-consistency-statement]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-set","status":"resolved","id":"975b3aa9a1e08797","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$B,T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G$ (base theory and compared theories, see [[92-df-theory-set]], [[92-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$B,T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G$ (base theory and compared theories, see [[92-df-theory-set]], [[92-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory-system","status":"resolved","id":"09b80989dbe14044","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sys}_G(B),\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T),\\mathrm{Sys}_G(U)$ (canonical formal-system presentations, see [[92-df-theory-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-parametrized-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"a02811a5f1367e7a","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}_T,\\mathrm{Con}_U\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G$ (arithmetized consistency sentences for the chosen presentations of $T,U$, see [[92-df-parametrized-consistency-statement]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\vdash$ (provability relation, see [[92-df-provable]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B,T,U\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sys}_G(B),\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T),\\mathrm{Sys}_G(U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}_T,\\mathrm{Con}_U\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"T,U","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{Con}}^B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}strength}\\vdash\nT\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{Con}}^B U\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Sys}_G(B)\\vdash(\\mathrm{Con}_U\\to\\mathrm{Con}_T)","display":true},{"tex":"T\\preccurlyeq_{\\mathrm{Con}}^B U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sys}_G(B)","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sys}_G(B)","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"T,U","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":2311,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-consistency-strength]]"}],"outgoing":["97